+### How deploys are triggered (important)
+
+The workflow runs on pushes to `main` **except when every changed file is
+archive JSON** (`public/archive/**`, `public/data/**`). Archive edits are
+committed by the backend and the site reads them live from
+raw.githubusercontent.com, so re-deploying on every JSON commit would be
+pure waste. Concretely:
+
+- commit touches only episode/movie/character/gadget JSON → **no deploy**
+- commit touches any website file (JS, CSS, HTML, workflow, package.json…) → **deploy**
+- commit mixes both → **deploy** (the site changed)
